# CareWell Hospital Management System — Environment Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# This repository is organized as a full-stack project:
#
# 1. Backend  (/backend)  — Express REST API
#    Template: backend/.env.example
#    Variables: MONGO_URI, TOKEN_KEY, ACCESS_CODE, FRONTEND_URL, PORT
#
# 2. Frontend (/frontend) — React + Vite SPA
#    Template: frontend/.env.example
#    Variables: VITE_API_URL
